WEBVTT

00:00:35.890 --> 00:00:39.810
Why... can't I kill you?

00:00:39.810 --> 00:00:41.970
Why?!

00:00:43.140 --> 00:00:45.730
Why?

00:00:55.530 --> 00:00:57.320
Damn it.

00:00:57.320 --> 00:00:59.450
Damn it!

00:01:03.120 --> 00:01:07.000
I'm sorry, Vanitas.

00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:12.420
Forgive me.

00:01:16.090 --> 00:01:19.930
"His Wish"

00:01:35.570 --> 00:01:39.030
Vanitas! Pull yourself together!

00:01:39.030 --> 00:01:41.450
I don't understand.

00:01:41.450 --> 00:01:43.160
Why?!

00:01:43.160 --> 00:01:45.160
Why can't you kill him?!

00:01:45.160 --> 00:01:50.170
He tried to suck your blood!
You could've killed him!

00:01:50.170 --> 00:01:53.840
So why didn't you?!
I'm the only one you need!

00:01:53.840 --> 00:01:57.170
Who cares if he dies?!

00:01:57.170 --> 00:01:58.760
You...

00:01:58.760 --> 00:02:05.220
You tried to get me to suck
Vanitas's blood so he would kill me?

00:02:05.220 --> 00:02:09.480
If only Father, my big brother,
and I could be reunited.

00:02:09.480 --> 00:02:12.940
That's all I wanted!

00:02:12.940 --> 00:02:16.610
But you won't do what I asked, Noé.

00:02:16.610 --> 00:02:20.070
So Mademoiselle Domi must die.

00:02:32.040 --> 00:02:33.340
Let me go.

00:02:33.340 --> 00:02:34.210
No.

00:02:34.210 --> 00:02:40.340
But Misha said I have to jump. I must die.

00:02:40.340 --> 00:02:41.970
No.

00:02:41.970 --> 00:02:46.180
Why? You agreed, didn't you?

00:02:46.180 --> 00:02:47.890
Noé would be better off without--

00:02:47.890 --> 00:02:50.770
I already told you no!

00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:54.570
I... I hate myself.

00:02:54.570 --> 00:02:58.860
I'm indecisive and pathetic.
I absolutely hate myself!

00:02:58.860 --> 00:03:02.870
Still, I draw the line at just one thing.

00:03:02.870 --> 00:03:06.370
I will <i>never</i> forgive anyone who hurts Noé.

00:03:06.370 --> 00:03:11.670
If killing myself enrages Noé like that,

00:03:11.670 --> 00:03:15.630
I must never allow it to happen.

00:03:15.630 --> 00:03:19.840
B-But, Misha told me I must jump.

00:03:19.840 --> 00:03:23.760
I must do as I'm told.

00:03:25.350 --> 00:03:27.260
You must have realized by now.

00:03:27.260 --> 00:03:31.940
She <i>is</i> you, or at least the real you
that you've always tried to ignore.

00:03:31.940 --> 00:03:32.560
--It's no use.

00:03:32.560 --> 00:03:33.350
--I'm sorry.
--It's no use.

00:03:33.350 --> 00:03:33.810
--I'm sorry.
--I promised.

00:03:33.810 --> 00:03:34.440
--Jeanne.
--I promised.

00:03:34.440 --> 00:03:35.110
--Jeanne.
--I hate her.

00:03:35.110 --> 00:03:36.940
--Don't hate Noé.
--I hate her.

00:03:36.940 --> 00:03:37.320
--No.

00:03:37.320 --> 00:03:37.820
--I'm scared.
--No.

00:03:37.820 --> 00:03:38.400
--I'm scared.
--Why?

00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:38.820
--Louis, I'm sorry.
--Why?

00:03:38.820 --> 00:03:40.110
--Louis, I'm sorry.
--I...

00:03:40.110 --> 00:03:41.650
Please forgive me.

00:03:41.650 --> 00:03:48.660
Mikhail used that book to prey on the
most fragile and vulnerable part of you.

00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:58.460
Our true names aren't
defiled in the least.

00:04:01.380 --> 00:04:03.430
Mademoiselle!

00:04:03.430 --> 00:04:07.350
Why won't you listen to me?!

00:04:12.520 --> 00:04:15.730
I'll just have to make do with you.

00:04:15.730 --> 00:04:19.280
Kill everyone here.

00:04:19.280 --> 00:04:20.780
Kill.

00:04:20.780 --> 00:04:22.030
Kill!

00:04:22.030 --> 00:04:23.700
<i>Kill</i>!

00:04:30.040 --> 00:04:31.540
Huh?

00:04:32.620 --> 00:04:36.130
What's happening?! No!

00:04:43.590 --> 00:04:47.970
Big brother.

00:04:47.970 --> 00:04:49.890
What the devil?!

00:04:49.890 --> 00:04:54.060
It's as if <i>The Book of Vanitas</i>
is devouring Mikhail.

00:04:59.820 --> 00:05:04.240
Noé. Forget about me. Get out of here now!

00:05:04.240 --> 00:05:05.150
Huh?

00:05:05.150 --> 00:05:08.570
Mikhail has sent the book
spiraling out of control.

00:05:08.570 --> 00:05:11.910
He overly interfered with the
astermite in the amusement park.

00:05:11.910 --> 00:05:12.830
No.

00:05:12.830 --> 00:05:15.960
If it all explodes at once...

00:05:15.960 --> 00:05:17.620
I said no!

00:05:26.630 --> 00:05:28.800
Vanitas! Noé!

00:05:44.650 --> 00:05:46.780
Ice?

00:05:50.160 --> 00:05:53.290
Lady Dominique?

00:05:53.290 --> 00:05:54.870
It's all right.

00:05:54.870 --> 00:06:00.130
Look out for me, and I will
do the same for you two.

00:06:06.630 --> 00:06:12.220
Now, let's take up our swords together
to protect that which we love.

00:06:13.850 --> 00:06:20.400
Mademoiselle, kill them
one and all. Kill them.

00:06:20.400 --> 00:06:24.820
Kill them!

00:06:42.920 --> 00:06:46.960
She is so... beautiful.

00:06:58.430 --> 00:07:00.940
Domi. Domi!

00:07:00.940 --> 00:07:02.350
Noé.

00:07:15.370 --> 00:07:18.500
Big brother.

00:07:21.790 --> 00:07:24.790
Help me.

00:07:26.170 --> 00:07:29.090
Big brother.

00:07:31.720 --> 00:07:35.970
Big brother.

00:07:35.970 --> 00:07:38.930
Big brother.

00:07:56.870 --> 00:07:58.740
It hurts.

00:07:58.740 --> 00:08:00.870
It hurts so bad!

00:08:00.870 --> 00:08:04.170
Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow...

00:08:04.170 --> 00:08:09.210
It really hurts, big brother!

00:08:17.100 --> 00:08:18.220
Hey!

00:08:18.220 --> 00:08:20.430
Vanitas?! What's wrong?!

00:08:20.430 --> 00:08:23.480
Oh, how marvelous.

00:08:26.190 --> 00:08:30.280
I was worried that I should
have stopped you sooner,

00:08:30.280 --> 00:08:33.740
but I'm glad I didn't.

00:08:33.740 --> 00:08:40.450
That was truly marvelous.
And it's thanks to you I saw it.

00:08:40.450 --> 00:08:46.960
It has been quite some time,
Mes Chatons, my dearest kittens.

00:08:54.380 --> 00:08:58.140
G-Grandfather? What are you doing here?!

00:09:08.150 --> 00:09:10.860
A pleasure to meet you, Hellfire Witch,

00:09:10.860 --> 00:09:15.400
and you, who number
among the Blue Moon Clan.

00:09:15.400 --> 00:09:18.990
Perhaps you've never
seen me in this form before?

00:09:20.410 --> 00:09:24.660
The former Marquis de Sade,
the Shapeless One.

00:09:24.660 --> 00:09:29.670
My darling kittens appear
to be in your debt.

00:09:29.670 --> 00:09:33.340
A kind voice and a gentle smile.

00:09:33.340 --> 00:09:37.720
To think it would feel so
dreadful to not feel dread.

00:09:37.720 --> 00:09:40.140
Teacher.

00:09:40.140 --> 00:09:43.560
Teacher, why are you with Mikhail?

00:09:43.560 --> 00:09:47.060
Monsieur le Comte, it hurts.

00:09:47.060 --> 00:09:50.730
It hurts so bad. Help me.

00:09:52.730 --> 00:09:57.200
Someone kind saved me.

00:09:57.200 --> 00:10:02.660
Teacher, are you that "someone kind"
Mikhail mentioned?

00:10:04.580 --> 00:10:06.660
Did you...?

00:10:06.660 --> 00:10:14.550
Did you tell him there was a way to bring
the Vampire of the Blue Moon back to life?

00:10:15.880 --> 00:10:18.380
That I did.

00:10:18.380 --> 00:10:19.680
Why, you--!

00:10:19.680 --> 00:10:23.350
You said that we may have never
seen you in your present form.

00:10:23.350 --> 00:10:26.850
So then, where have we met before?!

00:10:29.480 --> 00:10:32.610
Does the Comte de
Saint Germain ring a bell?

00:10:32.610 --> 00:10:38.820
It's the name I go by these days.
Make sure you get it right next time.

00:10:40.200 --> 00:10:42.990
The Kingdom of Dreams lies in ruins.

00:10:42.990 --> 00:10:47.080
Whether it's a sweet dream
like a gently rocking cradle

00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:52.380
or a nightmare that gnaws at your soul,
a dream is simply a dream.

00:10:52.380 --> 00:10:58.470
One will always wake to face reality.

00:10:58.470 --> 00:11:05.430
Let us meet again when that time comes,
dearest kitten, Mon Chaton.

00:11:05.430 --> 00:11:12.310
And you as well, human heir to Blue,
the most beautiful being in the world.

00:11:15.770 --> 00:11:16.020
--Wait.

00:11:16.020 --> 00:11:17.780
--Teacher!
--Wait.

00:11:23.950 --> 00:11:24.780
Noé!

00:11:24.780 --> 00:11:26.700
Vanitas!

00:11:26.700 --> 00:11:30.460
<i>Bonsoir</i>, little one.

00:12:11.750 --> 00:12:15.210
Good morning, Monsieur Noé.

00:12:16.290 --> 00:12:17.960
Mademoiselle Amelia?

00:12:17.960 --> 00:12:20.420
Yes, it's me.

00:12:20.420 --> 00:12:21.590
What happened?

00:12:21.590 --> 00:12:24.180
Everyone is safe and sound.

00:12:26.890 --> 00:12:32.730
They were quite worried about you, too.

00:12:35.190 --> 00:12:37.230
Forgive me.

00:12:37.230 --> 00:12:40.360
I'm grateful for your help,
Mademoiselle Amelia.

00:12:40.360 --> 00:12:45.280
Now, shall I fetch you some
water and some light fare?

00:12:45.280 --> 00:12:48.700
No, I can manage that myself.

00:12:50.370 --> 00:12:56.120
Lady Dominique and Mademoiselle Jeanne
are having a talk in the dining room.

00:12:56.120 --> 00:12:59.880
Please give them some
privacy until they are done.

00:13:03.970 --> 00:13:06.470
He's up there.

00:13:06.470 --> 00:13:10.470
I'll have food for two prepared for you.

00:13:47.340 --> 00:13:49.300
Um...

00:13:50.300 --> 00:13:53.720
Are you hurt bad?

00:13:55.520 --> 00:14:00.020
I'm sorry. Of course you are.

00:14:03.900 --> 00:14:08.280
Vanitas, won't you come inside?

00:14:08.280 --> 00:14:13.330
But if I'm bothering you,
I'll leave you alone.

00:14:13.330 --> 00:14:15.080
I've been waiting...

00:14:17.410 --> 00:14:19.710
...for him to come.

00:14:24.550 --> 00:14:25.210
--Mik--

00:14:25.210 --> 00:14:25.880
--Noé.
--Mik--

00:14:25.880 --> 00:14:26.510
--Noé.

00:14:28.050 --> 00:14:32.930
You needn't do anything.
Just stay right there.

00:14:46.320 --> 00:14:48.700
Yesterday...

00:14:48.700 --> 00:14:53.740
Yesterday, I wanted to ask
something but couldn't.

00:14:53.740 --> 00:14:58.620
So I wanted to ask you now.

00:15:05.550 --> 00:15:09.380
Is it my fault that Father died?

00:15:10.680 --> 00:15:16.350
I can't remember that day--
the day he died and I lost my arm.

00:15:16.350 --> 00:15:20.230
I-It's all... It's all my--

00:15:20.230 --> 00:15:21.650
No.

00:15:23.770 --> 00:15:26.150
I'm the killer.

00:15:28.610 --> 00:15:33.950
That was the day someone
stole Luna's true name.

00:15:33.950 --> 00:15:37.870
Luna was about to turn
into a deranged monster.

00:15:37.870 --> 00:15:42.330
That's why I joined the Blue Moon Clan

00:15:42.330 --> 00:15:46.880
and killed Luna with their own power.

00:15:48.300 --> 00:15:50.590
That is the truth.

00:15:52.340 --> 00:15:55.100
I cure curse-bearers

00:15:55.100 --> 00:16:01.020
in order to find clues to who
or what stole Luna's true name.

00:16:01.020 --> 00:16:04.980
I'll never forgive the
Vampire of the Blue Moon.

00:16:04.980 --> 00:16:09.860
I will wipe their existence
from the face of the earth.

00:16:09.860 --> 00:16:13.990
I will destroy and bury every last trace.

00:16:15.410 --> 00:16:19.120
That shall be my vengeance.

00:16:24.540 --> 00:16:27.090
That's why I can't go with you.

00:16:29.340 --> 00:16:32.170
H-How can you say that?

00:16:32.170 --> 00:16:35.680
If we bring Father back to life,
it will be just like it was back--

00:16:35.680 --> 00:16:38.680
The dead don't return.

00:16:38.680 --> 00:16:42.930
Even if they did, it would only be
something that resembled them.

00:16:42.930 --> 00:16:46.480
But you know just as well as I do!

00:16:46.480 --> 00:16:49.690
The more we use our books,

00:16:49.690 --> 00:16:52.190
the more we become
something that isn't human.

00:16:52.190 --> 00:16:54.950
They rewrite our very being.

00:16:54.950 --> 00:16:57.120
You saw me yesterday, didn't you?

00:16:57.120 --> 00:16:58.370
It's just like that.

00:16:58.370 --> 00:17:01.410
We'll gradually turn into
something other than ourselves.

00:17:01.410 --> 00:17:05.670
I'm the only one who can understand
that pain when you go through it.

00:17:05.670 --> 00:17:07.750
You said it yourself.

00:17:07.750 --> 00:17:10.000
"Even if it means dying tomorrow,

00:17:10.000 --> 00:17:12.760
I want to continue
being human to the end."

00:17:12.760 --> 00:17:16.720
I'll give you the gift of death
if you become a monster!

00:17:16.720 --> 00:17:19.720
After all, we're the same!

00:17:19.720 --> 00:17:22.680
So... please!

00:17:24.730 --> 00:17:27.230
I don't need you.

00:17:27.230 --> 00:17:31.650
If I can choose how to die...

00:17:33.320 --> 00:17:36.400
If I can make a wish...

00:17:44.370 --> 00:17:47.960
If I'm to be killed, I choose him.

00:18:34.460 --> 00:18:37.510
All right, fine.

00:18:37.510 --> 00:18:41.050
I'll bring back Father by myself.

00:18:41.050 --> 00:18:46.640
What is the Shapeless One,
the Comte de Saint Germain up to?

00:18:46.640 --> 00:18:49.770
Don't know. Don't care.

00:18:49.770 --> 00:18:54.190
I almost forgot. There's <i>is</i>
one thing I should tell you.

00:18:54.190 --> 00:18:57.740
Mademoiselle Domi hasn't killed anyone.

00:18:57.740 --> 00:19:00.990
The vampires became unstable when
I used the book to tamper with them,

00:19:00.990 --> 00:19:06.080
but she stopped them from
attacking humans several times.

00:19:06.080 --> 00:19:11.250
Make sure you tell that to the big wigs
so they don't do anything terrible to her.

00:19:11.250 --> 00:19:14.460
Why tell me that?

00:19:14.460 --> 00:19:18.380
Because she was nice to me.

00:19:18.380 --> 00:19:22.390
I like kind people.

00:19:32.600 --> 00:19:34.110
Hey, you're too heavy.

00:19:34.110 --> 00:19:36.730
It's just for a little while.

00:19:36.730 --> 00:19:39.820
Was it a good idea to let Mikhail go?

00:19:39.820 --> 00:19:43.030
You must have a thousand things
you'd like to ask him.

00:19:43.030 --> 00:19:47.950
You're right, but for now...

00:19:47.950 --> 00:19:50.750
I want to talk to you.

00:19:55.880 --> 00:19:57.920
Sorry.

00:19:59.510 --> 00:20:01.130
Huh?

00:20:01.130 --> 00:20:05.140
I was rash in so many ways.
Or maybe the other way around.

00:20:05.140 --> 00:20:10.180
I took too long or didn't do enough.

00:20:10.180 --> 00:20:13.770
I get worried when you act humble.

00:20:13.770 --> 00:20:15.940
Are you picking a fight?

00:20:19.030 --> 00:20:20.570
I give up.

00:20:20.570 --> 00:20:21.780
What?

00:20:21.780 --> 00:20:26.990
I said I've given up trying
to make you do what I want!

00:20:32.330 --> 00:20:34.210
You're still too heavy.

00:20:37.250 --> 00:20:40.260
So what now?

00:20:40.260 --> 00:20:43.720
First, I'll look into the
Comte de Saint Germain.

00:20:43.720 --> 00:20:44.800
Right.

00:20:44.800 --> 00:20:48.930
Besides that, nothing changes.

00:20:48.930 --> 00:20:53.270
I'm a doctor. I'll keep
treating curse-bearers.

00:20:53.270 --> 00:20:58.860
I will do as I please, and that is to
take my vengeance by saving vampires.

00:21:01.070 --> 00:21:04.200
Right. Nothing changes for me, either.

00:21:06.160 --> 00:21:07.700
Hey, quack!

00:21:07.700 --> 00:21:10.790
You're finally up!? What took so long?!

00:21:10.790 --> 00:21:14.410
Do you realize the hell we
went through after yesterday?

00:21:14.410 --> 00:21:17.790
Count Orlok blew a gasket!

00:21:17.790 --> 00:21:21.250
He wants to see you immediately!

00:21:21.250 --> 00:21:22.590
I'm scared.

00:21:22.590 --> 00:21:23.720
What a pain.

00:21:23.720 --> 00:21:26.470
And you owe me an apology
for the beating I took!

00:21:26.470 --> 00:21:28.180
My bad.

00:21:29.220 --> 00:21:33.220
Monsieur Vanitas, Monsieur Noé!
The sun has come out!

00:21:39.940 --> 00:21:41.570
Vanitas.

00:21:41.570 --> 00:21:43.480
Let's go.
